<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3129] Zepplin UI Doesnt logs out in IE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3129</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt; Zepplin UI Doesnt logs out in IE&lt;br/&gt;
Its Shows Logout Success and automatically reload the page &lt;br/&gt;
But the User is still logged in .&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The RootCause : &lt;br/&gt;
As per code : &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/6caf587e17fb6858e769fb2121b8cd66090ff759/zeppelin-web/src/components/navbar/navbar.controller.js#L93&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/6caf587e17fb6858e769fb2121b8cd66090ff759/zeppelin-web/src/components/navbar/navbar.controller.js#L93&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Zepplin is trying to pass username and password to the URL and IE doesnt support the feature (URL REFERENCE): &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/help/834489/internet-explorer-does-not-support-user-names-and-passwords-in-web-sit&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/help/834489/internet-explorer-does-not-support-user-names-and-passwords-in-web-sit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So for the Check of passing the username and password need to ignore if the browser is IE as IE doesnt support the same.&lt;br/&gt;
Please Fix this BUG&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Zepplin is using AD as way of authentication &lt;/p&gt;</environment>
